# PLACEHOLDER - CHECK THIS AGAINST THE SHARE BEFORE PROD
# The real file lives on the ATS share beside spol_JKT.tsr and is named in
# config_cash.xml.  Point TSR_DIR in local_settings.py at that folder; this
# copy exists only so the shipped config can be validated offline.
#
# The ladder below is the published KRX schedule, not a file taken off the
# share.  It is what makes a 5,150 close round to a 10 tick, which is the
# case it was written for.  If the share's own file disagrees anywhere, the
# share wins - it is what the trading system rounds by.
#
# Format: RuleName Floor TickValue  - lines with fewer than 3 fields are
# skipped, and the rule name is ignored entirely.
SPOL_KSC 0 1
SPOL_KSC 2000 5
SPOL_KSC 5000 10
SPOL_KSC 20000 50
SPOL_KSC 50000 100
SPOL_KSC 200000 500
SPOL_KSC 500000 1000
